<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  2.56% (Discount)	  O/N = 2.56% (Discount)</p>
<p>	    T/N =  2.56% (Discount)	  T/N = Par</p>
<p>		   Oct 30, 1996			Oct 29, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  1.70%	1 month forward =  2.39%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  3.07%	2 month forward =  3.92%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  4.89%	3 month forward =  5.35%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  5.54%	4 month forward =  5.97%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  6.34%	5 month forward =  6.62%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  6.44%	6 month forward =  6.68%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
